{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And the person who turns to the medium.</b> Its meaning: just as I cut off the one who gives of his seed to Molech, whether in secret or in public, if the people of the land do not put him to death, so I cut off the one who goes whoring after [YHWH] to turn to mediums. And we find [singular] נפש [alongside] also every נפש [as] fourteen. And likewise, 'and I will cut him off' [Leviticus 20:6]."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {0 "Resolved האבת as a reference to mediums (אובות), matching the verse context and the standard text of Ibn Ezra's commentary; the lemma as printed lacks the expected vav-yod."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:18.122301299Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}